{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024115950017-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024133204\"/><p>警員封鎖酒吧調查。(張開裕攝)</p><p>太子發生傷人案。今晨(24日)10時22分，執法部門接獲市民報案指，在西洋菜北街225號對開街頭發現一名頭部受傷半昏迷的男子。救援人員接報到場，將事主送明愛醫院救治。警員到場調查，封鎖上址一間酒吧調查，並酒吧內發現血漬，正調查事件的來龍去脈。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:26.245686+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:59:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:58:27.246045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:25.231010+00:00","content_hash":"a4703dfcc19eb27348b66eeae4e2fcdb6c5da5319dd2674768d1fc41f1d2e6d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}